{% set volatile_placement = volatile_context_placement() %}
{# CHARACTER EVIDENCE: authored entries are stable, everything else changes per turn #}
{% set planning_evidence = agent_action("director", "guidance_context", budget=[max_tokens // 3, 16384]|min) if character_knowledge_enabled(scene) else [] %}
{% set authored_evidence %}{% with evidence_part="stable" %}{% include "character-evidence-planning.jinja2" %}{% endwith %}{% endset %}
{% set current_evidence %}{% with evidence_part="current" %}{% include "character-evidence-planning.jinja2" %}{% endwith %}{% endset %}
{# RENDERED CONTEXT #}
{% set rendered_context -%}
<|SECTION:Scene Direction Context|>
You are the Director operating in autonomous mode for a dynamic storytelling/roleplaying text-based experience provided through a system called Talemate.

In this mode, you autonomously decide what actions to take to progress or enhance the scene, without waiting for user input. You are taking your "turn" to shape and direct the narrative.

CRITICAL: You are NOT acting in the scene. You are NOT the characters. You are directing the scene from outside it. You affect the scene through your AVAILABLE ACTIONS.
<|CLOSE_SECTION|>

{% with technical=True, include_instructions=False %}
{% include "scene-intent-hybrid.jinja2" %}
{% endwith %}

{% if scene.active_pins %}
<|SECTION:ACTIVE PINS|>
These context IDs are currently pinned to all context.

{% for pin in scene.active_pins %}- `{{ pin.context_id }}`
{% endfor %}
<|CLOSE_SECTION|>

{% endif %}

{% endset %}

{# Capture once: identical content and budget in both layouts. #}
{% set rules_text %}{% include "scene-direction-instructions.jinja2" %}{% endset %}
{% set context_ids_text %}{% include "useful-context-ids.jinja2" %}{% endset %}
{% set custom_instructions_text %}{% include "director-instructions.jinja2" %}{% endset %}
{% set instructions_text %}
{{ context_ids_text }}
{{ rules_text }}
{{ custom_instructions_text }}
{% endset %}

{# GAMESTATE CONTEXT #}
{% set gamestate_context %}
{% with max_gamestate_tokens=budgets.max_gamestate_tokens %}{% include "gamestate-context.jinja2" %}{% endwith %}
{% endset %}

{# Compute reserved from context + instructions #}
{% set reserved_tokens = count_tokens(authored_evidence + current_evidence + rendered_context + instructions_text + gamestate_context) %}
{% set _ = budgets.set_reserved(reserved_tokens) %}

{# SCENE CONTEXT #}
{% set scene_context_text %}
{% with budget=budgets.scene_context %}{% include "scene-context-chat.jinja2" %}{% endwith %}
{% endset %}

{# DIRECTION HISTORY (bounded by budgets.direction_history via callable) #}
{% set trimmed_history = direction_history_trim(history, budgets.direction_history) %}

{# RENDER PROMPT #}
{# Cached layout: stable rules and context first, then the direction history and
   the scene (both only grow at the end), then everything that changes per turn. #}
{% set direction_history_section %}
<|SECTION:Direction History - Your Previous Decisions This Session|>
{% if trimmed_history %}
{% for m in trimmed_history %}
{% if m.type == 'action_result' %}
[#{{ loop.index }}] [action] Executed `{{ m.name }}`
Instructions: `{{ m.instructions }}`

Result: {{ json(m.result) }}
---
{% elif m.type == 'summary' %}
[#{{ loop.index }}] [summary] {{ m.message }}
---
{% elif m.type == 'user_interaction' %}
[#{{ loop.index }}] [user] {% if m.is_direction %}User instruction: {{ m.preview }}{% elif m.user_input and m.user_input.strip() %}User interacted: {{ m.preview }}{% else %}User decided to yield the turn back to you{% endif %}
---
{% else %}
[#{{ loop.index }}] [director] {{ m.message }}
---
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No previous decisions in this session yet. This is your first turn.
{% endif %}
<|CLOSE_SECTION|>
{% endset %}
{% if volatile_placement == "after_history" %}
{{ rules_text }}
{{ context_ids_text }}
